msgid "快速入门"
msgstr "Quick Start"

msgid "项目介绍"
msgstr "Project Introduction"

msgid "**Triton-Ascend**是适配华为Ascend处理器的Triton优化版本，用于高效进行核函数自动调优、算子编译及部署，通过兼容Triton核心语法并针对昇腾NPU特性进行深度优化，能够帮助用户在昇腾平台上快速开发和部署高性能计算任务。"
msgstr "**Triton-Ascend** is an optimized version of Triton adapted for Huawei Ascend processors, used for efficient kernel auto-tuning, operator compilation, and deployment. By being compatible with Triton core syntax and performing deep optimization for Ascend NPU features, it helps users quickly develop and deploy high-performance computing tasks on the Ascend Platform."

msgid "本文以**Ubuntu 22.04**环境下通过软件包部署方式在线安装并运行向量加法示例为例，指导用户快速上手使用**Triton-Ascend**。如需体验更多安装方式请阅读[安装指南](./installation_guide.md)文档。"
msgstr "This guide helps you quickly get started with **Triton-Ascend** by installing and running the vector addition sample online through software package deployment in an **Ubuntu 22.04** environment. For more installation methods, refer to the [Installation Guide](./installation_guide.md) document."

msgid "环境准备"
msgstr "Environment Preparation"

msgid "**硬件要求**"
msgstr "**Hardware Requirements**"

msgid "支持的操作系统：Linux（aarch64/x86_64）"
msgstr "Supported operating systems: Linux (aarch64/x86_64)"

msgid "支持的Ascend产品：Atlas A2/A3/950系列"
msgstr "Supported Ascend products: Atlas A2/A3/950 series"

msgid "最小硬件配置：单卡32GB内存（推荐）"
msgstr "Minimum hardware configuration: single card with 32GB memory (recommended)"

msgid "**软件依赖**"
msgstr "**Software Dependencies**"

msgid "确定CANN、Python和TorchNPU软件版本并安装。其中，可以参考昇腾社区官网《[CANN快速安装](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)》完成驱动与固件安装。"
msgstr "Determine the software versions of CANN, Python, and TorchNPU, and install them. For driver and firmware installation, refer to the [CANN Quick Installation](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download) guide on the Ascend community official website."

msgid "CANN版本：9.1.0"
msgstr "CANN version: 9.1.0"

msgid "Python版本：python3.11"
msgstr "Python version: python3.11"

msgid "TorchNPU版本：2.7.1.post8"
msgstr "TorchNPU version: 2.7.1.post8"

msgid "注：更多配套关系请参考[版本说明表](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)。"
msgstr "Note: For more compatibility details, please refer to the [Version Compatibility Matrix](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)."

msgid "快速安装"
msgstr "Quick Start Installation"

msgid "pip install triton-ascend --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi\\n"
msgstr "pip install triton-ascend --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi"

msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick Start"

msgid "**运行tutorials中的向量加法示例验证结果**"
msgstr "**Run the vector addition sample in the tutorials to verify the results**"

msgid "向量加法示例：[01-vector-add.py](../../third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py) 通过对比Triton算子与PyTorch原生计算的输出结果，证明昇腾NPU设备可正确调用Triton算子并保证计算精度。"
msgstr "Vector addition sample: [01-vector-add.py](../../third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py) compares the outputs of the Triton operator and the native PyTorch calculation, demonstrating that the Ascend NPU device correctly calls the Triton operator and ensures calculation accuracy."

msgid "⚠️ 下述命令需在bash环境下执行。若使用POSIX sh，请将 `source` 替换为 `.`。"
msgstr "⚠️ Run the following commands in a bash environment. If you use POSIX sh, replace `source` with `.`."

msgid "# Set the CANN environment variables (using the root user's default installation path `/usr/local/Ascend` as an example)\\n"
msgstr "# Set the CANN environment variables (using the root user's default installation path `/usr/local/Ascend` as an example)"

msgid "观察到类似的输出即说明环境配置正确。"
msgstr "Observing similar output indicates that the environment configuration is correct."

msgid "tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')\\n"
msgstr "tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')"

msgid "下一步：从样例到完整开发"
msgstr "Next steps: From samples to full development"

msgid "本页帮助您完成安装与首个样例验证。若希望继续上手算子开发全流程，可按下面路径推进："
msgstr "This page helps you complete the installation and verify your first sample. If you want to proceed with the full operator development workflow, follow the path below:"

msgid "**算子开发**：按算子类型阅读 Vector / Cube / 融合开发教程，再对照典型样例修改 Kernel，完成开发、编译、验证闭环。"
msgstr "**Operator development**: Read the Vector / Cube / fusion development tutorials by operator type. Then modify the kernel by referring to typical samples to complete the development, compilation, and verification closed loop."

msgid "**自动调优**：使用 Autotune 选择合适的 Tiling 配置。"
msgstr "**Autotune**: Use Autotune to select an appropriate tiling configuration."

msgid "**调试与调优**：掌握打印调试与性能采集方法。"
msgstr "**Debugging and tuning**: Master print debugging and performance profiling methods."

msgid "**迁移与进阶**：从 GPU Triton 迁移到 Ascend，或查阅环境变量与编译选项。"
msgstr "**Migration and Advanced Topics**: Migrate from GPU Triton to Ascend, or refer to environment variables and compilation options."

